{"4119960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Not A Safe Place", "steam_appid": 4119960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in darkness. No daylight. No exit. Only cold rock, the echo of your footsteps – and the rustle of paper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within a labyrinthine cave system, you come across the abandoned notes of <strong>Zac</strong>, a missing person who fell into the same abyss years ago. His words become your map, and you follow his fate step by step – and the closer you get to him, the blurrier the line between truth and madness becomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find paths where none should exist.</strong> Explore branching tunnels, solve environmental puzzles, and open hidden passages. <strong>Listen to every sound</strong> – something lives down here, and it hunts in the dark. Without weapons, you only have your wits, caution, and the faint glow of your light source. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape? Or will you become the next <strong>echo wave</strong> in the depths?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in darkness. No daylight. No exit. Only cold rock, the echo of your footsteps – and the rustle of paper. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within a labyrinthine cave system, you come across the abandoned notes of <strong>Zac</strong>, a missing person who fell into the same abyss years ago. His words become your map, and you follow his fate step by step – and the closer you get to him, the blurrier the line between truth and madness becomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find paths where none should exist.</strong> Explore branching tunnels, solve environmental puzzles, and open hidden passages. <strong>Listen to every sound</strong> – something lives down here, and it hunts in the dark. Without weapons, you only have your wits, caution, and the faint glow of your light source. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape? Or will you become the next <strong>echo wave</strong> in the depths?</p>", "short_description": "Trapped in an endless cave without light. Only the dripping of water, your footsteps – and Zac's yellowed notes. Solve puzzles, find secret paths, and survive as reality and madness dangerously draw near.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119960/b4e619499f6a8fc188ffffbb79342759f60637cb/header.jpg?t=1775589711", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119960/3c413f92f33ce3daa5b18a82bcc2ca2bc5dcc154/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775589711", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119960/3c413f92f33ce3daa5b18a82bcc2ca2bc5dcc154/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775589711", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 or AMD Athlon X4 860K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 / AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 or AMD Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD RX 6700 XT or better<br></li><li